    "pb_brand_rows": {
      "type": "pb-feature-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "row_1": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "image_left",
            "heading": "Comprehensive Protection. Inside and Out.",
            "text": "<p>At the heart of Permagard is its advanced Reactive Polymer Protection System, engineered to create a durable, high-gloss protective barrier that enhances paint depth and clarity while helping defend against UV exposure, oxidation and environmental contaminants.</p><p>Permagard's premium protection range extends beyond the exterior, with specialised treatments for fabric, leather, plastic and vinyl surfaces to help guard against spills, stains and everyday wear.</p>",
            "watermark": "Permagard"
          }
        },
        "row_2": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "image_right",
            "heading": "Professionally Applied. Internationally Trusted.",
            "text": "<p>Available through select dealership partners and supported by Protection Brands in Australia, Permagard combines internationally proven technology with professional application, dedicated customer support and warranty-backed confidence.</p><p>Designed for owners who appreciate quality, craftsmanship and lasting results, Permagard helps preserve the appearance and enjoyment of your vehicle for years to come.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "row_1",
        "row_2"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "row_gap": 96,
        "background": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#111111"
      }
    },
